{"4568320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Flesh Grinding", "steam_appid": 4568320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind flesh. Gather blood. Upgrade. A first-person incremental horror game where you manage a macabre basement. Buy dark upgrades. boost your efficiency. and push your machinery to the limit while avoiding the terrifying entity that watches your every move. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568320/extras/f6aca64ec4bcbfe1e06908cf5d1e1ba6.avif?t=1786004698\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568320/extras/1df9108aa20ed4d4f8df8b2c92b07591.poster.avif?t=1786004698\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568320/extras/1df9108aa20ed4d4f8df8b2c92b07591.webm?t=1786004698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568320/extras/1df9108aa20ed4d4f8df8b2c92b07591.mp4?t=1786004698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Process the Flesh:</strong> Feed raw. grotesque mass to the grinder. Watch it tear and transform into your currency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harvest the Lifeforce:</strong> Extract pulsing blood from every grind. Manage your tanks, every drop is fuel for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bleed for Efficiency:</strong> Spend your crimson profits on sinister upgrades and multiply your yield.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568320/extras/f8ea083dee28af36aa8f21feb00fd793.avif?t=1786004698\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568320/extras/aa6796d4a9cdb2bc78f09dd398a5d0a6.poster.avif?t=1786004698\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568320/extras/aa6796d4a9cdb2bc78f09dd398a5d0a6.webm?t=1786004698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568320/extras/aa6796d4a9cdb2bc78f09dd398a5d0a6.mp4?t=1786004698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ledger of Flesh:</strong> Approach the old woman to unlock your dark. blood-fueled upgrade tree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boost Your Efficiency: </strong>Perfect your performance. Increase your grinding rate and multiply your crimson gains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Warping Reality:</strong> Do not trust your eyes. Something shifts every time you look away.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568320/extras/771b06e0c10464b734aefdef3b121a0b.avif?t=1786004698\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568320/extras/b9555bca1ba635e2d6b3e66b4d9da529.poster.avif?t=1786004698\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568320/extras/b9555bca1ba635e2d6b3e66b4d9da529.webm?t=1786004698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568320/extras/b9555bca1ba635e2d6b3e66b4d9da529.mp4?t=1786004698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Grinding Tech: </strong>Scale the horror. Upgrade your workshop with industrial tools to maximize your daily grind. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimize Logistics:</strong> Unlock the transport cart to move heavy cargo effortlessly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specialized Machinery:</strong> Deploy containment extractors. blood generators. and other cryptic devices. What else will the basement let you build?</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind flesh. Gather blood. Upgrade. A first-person incremental horror game where you manage a macabre basement. Buy dark upgrades. boost your efficiency. and push your machinery to the limit while avoiding the terrifying entity that watches your every move. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568320/extras/f6aca64ec4bcbfe1e06908cf5d1e1ba6.avif?t=1786004698\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568320/extras/1df9108aa20ed4d4f8df8b2c92b07591.poster.avif?t=1786004698\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568320/extras/1df9108aa20ed4d4f8df8b2c92b07591.webm?t=1786004698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568320/extras/1df9108aa20ed4d4f8df8b2c92b07591.mp4?t=1786004698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Process the Flesh:</strong> Feed raw. grotesque mass to the grinder. Watch it tear and transform into your currency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harvest the Lifeforce:</strong> Extract pulsing blood from every grind. Manage your tanks, every drop is fuel for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bleed for Efficiency:</strong> Spend your crimson profits on sinister upgrades and multiply your yield.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568320/extras/f8ea083dee28af36aa8f21feb00fd793.avif?t=1786004698\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568320/extras/aa6796d4a9cdb2bc78f09dd398a5d0a6.poster.avif?t=1786004698\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568320/extras/aa6796d4a9cdb2bc78f09dd398a5d0a6.webm?t=1786004698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568320/extras/aa6796d4a9cdb2bc78f09dd398a5d0a6.mp4?t=1786004698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ledger of Flesh:</strong> Approach the old woman to unlock your dark. blood-fueled upgrade tree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boost Your Efficiency: </strong>Perfect your performance. Increase your grinding rate and multiply your crimson gains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Warping Reality:</strong> Do not trust your eyes. Something shifts every time you look away.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https: